( C66 {F4 T6f, 2026-10-16} axisymmetric tria6 = Professional 02-08-2026: accepted {GNU before: refused, rc 1}, 7-point rule in EVERY element, including the elements with a node on the axis {the points are interior, r > 0, so the hoop term h/r stays finite: no per-element rule switch, unlike the tria3 nodal rule C83 and the quad Lobatto rules C71}, nodal stress = physical linear fit 1,r,z of the point values {no on-axis h-average, unlike the quads}, arithmetic mean. 12 distorted tria6, the left column on the axis {nodes 1, 4, 6, 13, 15 at r=0}. Prescribed nonlinear velocity at every node of a viscous materi. Targets = Professional node_dof. )

